---
import { homepage } from "@data/site";
---

<section class="qualification" id="who-it-is-for" aria-labelledby="qualification-title">
  <div class="ac-measure-intimate qualification__layout">
    <p class="qualification__index ac-eyebrow">Recognition</p>
    <h2 id="qualification-title" class="ac-type-h2">You are not looking for someone to carry out a few bags</h2>
    <p class="ac-type-body">
      You are trying to reach the point where the property can be listed,
      transferred, rented, returned, inspected, or simply closed without
      another unfinished task waiting behind the door.
    </p>
    <p class="ac-type-body">
      The house may still be full. The cleaning may be more than a normal
      cleaner will take on. Family members may disagree about what stays. You
      may be trying to manage the property from another city.
    </p>
    <p class="ac-type-body">
      Sometimes it is heavy accumulation that has built up for years.
      Sometimes it is an inherited or estate property with decisions no one
      has made yet. Sometimes it is a whole-house cleanout on a deadline, or a
      property nobody in the family can get to right now.
    </p>

    <ul class="qualification__ledger">
      {
        homepage.qualification.map((item) => (
          <li>
            <h3 class="ac-type-h3">{item.label}</h3>
            <p class="ac-type-body">{item.detail}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .qualification {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ac-color-steel-200);
    background: var(--ac-color-warm-white);
    padding-top: var(--ac-rhythm-standard);
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .qualification__layout {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--ac-space-4);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: var(--ac-space-3);
  }

  .qualification__ledger {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: var(--ac-space-6) 0 0;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ac-color-navy-900);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .qualification__ledger li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ac-color-rule);
    padding-block: var(--ac-space-5);
  }

  .qualification__ledger h3,
  .qualification__ledger p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .qualification__ledger p {
    margin-top: var(--ac-space-2);
    color: var(--ac-color-ink-500);
  }
</style>
